{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What better way to bring the charming and mysterious world of the witches to life than with an extensive soundtrack? <br><br>Team Tapas have reunited with the composer Crimsona, who previously collaborated with us on A Girl Adrift and Bistro Heroes, to create the perfect soundtrack for representing the dreamy world of the witches.<br><br>The soundtrack is filled with tracks composed to complement each member of the game's diverse coven of witches, as well as its various regions and ethereal storyline!<br><br>More songs will be added throughout the Early Access development process, all the way up until launch and beyond!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624950?t=1748942191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624950?t=1748942191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624950/d13602ed4189f910273ab7a85def8bd083215803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748942191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624950/d13602ed4189f910273ab7a85def8bd083215803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748942191","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What better way to bring the charming and mysterious world of the witches to life than with an extensive soundtrack? <br><br>Team Tapas have reunited with the composer Crimsona, who previously collaborated with us on A Girl Adrift and Bistro Heroes, to create the perfect soundtrack for representing the dreamy world of the witches.<br><br>The soundtrack is filled with tracks composed to complement each member of the game's diverse coven of witches, as well as its various regions and ethereal storyline!<br><br>More songs will be added throughout the Early Access development process, all the way up until launch and beyond!</p>","developers":["Team Tapas"],"fullgame":{"appi